lications must include a cover letter, curriculum vitae, writing sample, and, if a junior candidate, three letters of recommendation. Applications will be considered on a rolling basis; the submission deadline is November 15, 2026. Applications and questions should be addressed to: Associate Professor Andrew Sutherland (ags1@mit.edu) Chair, Accounting Group Search Committee"
